  {
   "id": "github:vllm-project/vllm@v0.32.0",
   "routine": "github",
   "date": "2026-10-21",
   "title": "vLLM v0.32.0",
   "url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/releases/tag/v0.32.0",
   "page": "github/2026-10-21#g-vllm-project-vllm-v0-32-0",
   "thumb": {
    "640": "thumbs/github/vllm-project-640.webp",
    "1280": "thumbs/github/vllm-project-1280.webp"
   },
   "summary": "New POST /v1/systemone endpoint for structured decisions (choice / score over a structured state), served by default, plus a generic hf tool-call and reasoning parser that reads the checkpoint's response_template, so no model-specific parser is needed · Low-precision KV cache across more GPUs: NVFP4 KV cache on SM8x, SM90 and SM12x; FP8 KV cache by default for GLM-5.x on SM100 (half the KV memory); a 4-bit KV cache on ROCm · New models: EmbeddingGemma 2 (omni-modal embeddings), MiniCPM-V 4.7 and Nemotron 3.5 ASR; video input through the Transformers backend; Model Runner V2 gains Elastic EP and a GPU n-gram speculator and is now the default on ROCm · Faster startup and serving: vllm download-kernels, autotune preload across restarts, and least-loaded routing across API workers (43–85% more req/s on short requests) · Breaking: Python 3.10 dropped, default CORS origins restricted, cascade attention removed, transformers pinned to < 5.20",
   "channel": "vLLM",
   "tags": [
    "vLLM",
    "latest at start"
   ],
   "pub": "2026-10-18",
   "seeded": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "github:sgl-project/sglang@v0.5.22",
   "routine": "github",
   "date": "2026-10-21",
   "title": "SGLang v0.5.22",
   "url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/releases/tag/v0.5.22",
   "page": "github/2026-10-21#g-sgl-project-sglang-v0-5-22",
   "thumb": {
    "640": "thumbs/github/sgl-project-640.webp",
    "1280": "thumbs/github/sgl-project-1280.webp"
   },
   "summary": "New models: Cloudflare Clef / Clef Flash, PPLX-Decider v1/v1.1, EmbeddingGemma 2 and LLaDA2.2, plus diffusion models HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct, Kandinsky 6, Wan-Animate-2 and SANA-Video 2.0 · DeepSeek-V4.1 gets up to 2.3x more throughput per GPU on H200 and now runs on AMD MI350X / MI355X · New InstantTensor loader loads models about 10x faster; PD disaggregation gets up to 27% more throughput and half the p95 TTFT on long prompts · Runs on Apple Silicon Macs with the standard PyTorch backend; HiSparse adds EAGLE/MTP speculative decoding; SGLang Diffusion works inside ComfyUI · Breaking: requires Python 3.11 or newer",
   "channel": "SGLang",
   "tags": [
    "SGLang",
    "latest at start"
   ],
   "pub": "2026-10-19",
   "seeded": 1
  },
