   "summary": "NVGEMM: CuTeDSL-generated CUTLASS kernels in Inductor with epilogue fusion and scaled/NVFP4 GEMM, autotuned alongside Triton and ATen · torch.switch for multi-way branching, torch.while_loop can be captured in CUDA graphs, and declarative dynamic shapes via @dynamic_spec across compile, export and make_fx · Preview of a rewritten NCCL backend and first-class fault tolerance in c10d (in-place process-group reconfiguration, one-sided RMA windows) · Native linear algebra on Apple Silicon (SVD, eigh, QR, Cholesky); ROCm 7.14 wheels, Intel XPU graph capture and Inductor support for Rubin (sm_107) · Breaking: deprecated torch.cholesky() and torch.qr() removed (use torch.linalg)",
