   "summary": "New models: Meta's Muse Spark Open (816B-total / 42B-active multimodal MoE taking text, image, audio and video, 1M-token context, BF16 and NVFP4 checkpoints), Ling 3.0 Flash (native, no trust_remote_code), Aleph Alpha's Kolibri 1, MiniCPM-V 4.7, Baidu's UnlimitedOcr, UltraBERT encoders and MOSS-Transcribe-Diarize · Exporters can now quantize during export across Dynamo, ONNX, OpenVINO and ExecuTorch (static/dynamic quantization, INT8/INT4 weight-only) · FSDP × TP model and optimizer checkpoints can be saved and loaded across different parallel layouts · Breaking: deprecated cache_utils methods removed, kernels ≥ 0.17.2 required, nested configs move to the new SubConfigSpec; the notes also warn that expert-parallel inference is currently slower",
